{"suttaId":"sn1.17","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-i","vriCode":"s0301m.mul","paras":[126,133],"vripara":"17"},"segments":{"sn1.17:0.3":"Dukkarasuttaṃ","sn1.17:1.1":"“Dukkaraṃ duttitikkhañca,","sn1.17:1.2":"abyattena ca sāmaññaṃ.","sn1.17:1.3":"Bahūhi tattha sambādhā,","sn1.17:1.4":"yattha bālo visīdatī”ti.","sn1.17:2.1":"“Katihaṃ careyya sāmaññaṃ,","sn1.17:2.2":"cittaṃ ce na nivāraye;","sn1.17:2.3":"Pade pade visīdeyya,","sn1.17:2.4":"saṅkappānaṃ vasānugo”ti.","sn1.17:3.1":"“Kummova aṅgāni sake kapāle,","sn1.17:3.2":"Samodahaṃ bhikkhu manovitakke;","sn1.17:3.3":"Anissito aññamaheṭhayāno,","sn1.17:3.4":"Parinibbuto nūpavadeyya kañcī”ti. 8."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-i","bookName":"Sagāthāvagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0301a.att","from":195,"to":197,"paras":[{"para":195,"vripara":"17","refs":["sn1.17:1"],"lines":["Sattame <b>duttitikkha</b>nti dukkhamaṃ duadhivāsiyaṃ.","<b>Abyattenā</b>ti bālena.","<b>Sāmañña</b>nti samaṇadhammo.","Iminā devatā idaṃ dasseti – yaṃ paṇḍitā kulaputtā dasapi vassāni vīsatipi saṭṭhipi vassāni dante abhidantamādhāya jivhāya tāluṃ āhaccapi cetasā cittaṃ abhiniggaṇhitvāpi ekāsanaṃ ekabhattaṃ paṭisevamānā āpāṇakoṭikaṃ brahmacariyaṃ carantā sāmaññaṃ karonti.","Taṃ bhagavā bālo abyatto kātuṃ na sakkotīti.","<b>Bahū hi tattha sambādhā</b>ti tasmiṃ sāmaññasaṅkhāte ariyamagge bahū sambādhā maggādhigamāya paṭipannassa pubbabhāge bahū parissayāti dasseti."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"]]},{"para":196,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.17:1","sn1.17:2"],"lines":["<b>Cittañce na nivāraye</b>ti yadi ayoniso uppannaṃ cittaṃ na nivāreyya, kati ahāni sāmaññaṃ careyya?","Ekadivasampi na careyya.","Cittavasiko hi samaṇadhammaṃ kātuṃ na sakkoti.","<b>Pade pade</b>ti ārammaṇe ārammaṇe.","Ārammaṇañhi idha padanti adhippetaṃ.","Yasmiṃ yasmiṃ hi ārammaṇe kileso uppajjati, tattha tattha bālo visīdati nāma.","Iriyāpathapadampi vaṭṭati.","Gamanādīsu hi yattha yattha kileso uppajjati, tattha tattheva visīdati nāma.","<b>Saṅkappāna</b>nti kāmasaṅkappādīnaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:2"],["sn1.17:2"],["sn1.17:2"],["sn1.17:2"],["sn1.17:2"],["sn1.17:2"]]},{"para":197,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.17:3"],"lines":["<b>Kummo vā</b>ti kacchapo viya.","<b>Aṅgānī</b>ti gīvapañcamāni aṅgāni.","<b>Samodaha</b>nti samodahanto, samodahitvā vā.","<b>Manovitakke</b>ti manamhi uppannavitakke.","Ettāvatā idaṃ dasseti – yathā kummo soṇḍipañcamāni aṅgāni sake kapāle samodahanto siṅgālassa otāraṃ na deti, samodahitvā cassa appasayhataṃ āpajjati, evamevaṃ bhikkhu manamhi uppannavitakke sake ārammaṇakapāle samodahaṃ mārassa otāraṃ na deti, samodahitvā cassa appasayhataṃ āpajjatīti.","<b>Anissito</b>ti taṇhādiṭṭhinissayehi anissito hutvā.","<b>Aheṭhayāno</b>ti avihiṃsamāno.","<b>Parinibbuto</b>ti kilesanibbānena parinibbuto.","<b>Nūpavadeyya kañcī</b>ti yaṃkiñci puggalaṃ ācāravipattiādīsu yāya kāyaci maṅkuṃ kātukāmo hutvā na vadeyya, “kālena vakkhāmi no akālenā”tiādayo pana pañca dhamme ajjhattaṃ upaṭṭhapetvā ullumpanasabhāvasaṇṭhitena cittena kāruññataṃ paṭicca vadeyyāti."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn1.17:1.1","duttitikkhaṃ",0,0],["sn1.17:1.1","abyattenā",0,1],["sn1.17:1.1","sāmaññaṃ",0,2],["sn1.17:1.3","bahū hi tattha sambādhā",0,5],["sn1.17:2.3","pade pade",1,3],["sn1.17:2.3","saṅkappānaṃ",1,8],["sn1.17:3.1","kummo vā",2,0],["sn1.17:3.1","aṅgānī",2,1],["sn1.17:3.2","samodahaṃ",2,2],["sn1.17:3.2","manovitakke",2,3],["sn1.17:3.3","anissito",2,5],["sn1.17:3.3","aheṭhayāno",2,6],["sn1.17:3.4","parinibbuto",2,7],["sn1.17:3.4","nūpavadeyya kañcī",2,8]],"before":[{"para":194,"vripara":null,"title":"Dukkarasuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Dukkarasuttavaṇṇanā 17."]}],"after":[{"para":198,"vripara":null,"title":"Dukkarasuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Dukkarasuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 8."]}]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-i","bookName":"Sagāthāvagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0301t.tik","from":306,"to":308,"paras":[{"para":306,"vripara":"17","refs":["sn1.17:1","sn1.17:2"],"lines":["Dukkhaṃ titikkhanti <b>duttitikkhaṃ</b>.","Tañca dukkhamaṃ dussahanaṃ ārambhavasena dukkaraṃ, anuyuñjanavasena duttitikkhanti.","<b>Abyattenā</b>ti sāmaññassa upakārānupakāre dhamme jānanasamatthāya veyyattiyasaṅkhātāya paññāya abhāvato na byattena.","Tenāha <b>“bālenā”</b>ti.","Yasmiṃ dhamme sati samaṇoti vuccati, taṃ sāmaññanti āha <b>“samaṇadhammo”</b>ti.","<b>Iminā</b>ti “dukkaraṃ duttitikkhañca, abyattena ca sāmañña”nti iminā gāthaddhena <b>idaṃ dassetī</b>ti idaṃ idāni vuccamānaṃ atthajātaṃ dasseti.","<b>Abhidanta</b>nti abhibhavanadantaṃ, uparidantanti attho.","So hi itaraṃ musalaṃ viya udukkhalaṃ visesato kassaci khādanakāle abhibhuyya vattati.","<b>Ādhāyā</b>ti nippīḷanavaseneva ṭhapetvā.","<b>Tāluṃ āhaccā</b>ti tālupadesamāhanitvā viya.","<b>Cetasā</b>ti kusalacittena.","<b>Citta</b>nti akusalacittaṃ.","<b>Abhiniggaṇhitvā</b>ti yathā atisamudācāro na hoti, evaṃ vibādhanavasena niggahetvā.","<b>Āpāṇakoṭika</b>nti pāṇakoṭipariyosānaṃ, parijīvanti attho.","Sambādhetīti <b>sambādho,</b> antarāyiko.","<b>Bahū parissayā</b>ti ayoniso kāmavitakkādivasena."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:2"],["sn1.17:2"],["sn1.17:2"],["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"]]},{"para":307,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.17:1"],"lines":["Pajjati cittametthāti padaṃ, ārammaṇaṃ.","Iriyāpathaṃ eva padaṃ <b>iriyāpathapadaṃ</b>."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:1"]]},{"para":308,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.17:1","sn1.17:3"],"lines":["Gīvā cattāro pādāti <b>gīvapañcamāni.</b>","<b>Samodaha</b>nti vā samodhānahetūti ayamettha atthoti āha –","<b>“samodahitvā vā”</b>ti, sammā odhāya anto pavesetvāti attho.","<b>Sake ārammaṇakapāle</b>ti gocarajjhattaṃ vadati.","<b>Samodaha</b>nti samodahanto.","<b>Anissito</b>ti tebhūmakadhammesu kañcipi dhammaṃ taṇhādiṭṭhābhinivesavasena anissito.","<b>Avihiṃsamāno</b> vihiṃsānimittānaṃ pajahanena.","<b>Ullumpanasabhāvasaṇṭhitenā</b>ti sīlabyasanato uddharaṇarūpe saṇṭhitena, karuṇāyuttenāti attho.","Tenāha <b>“kāruññataṃ paṭiccā”</b>ti."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.17:1"],["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"],["sn1.17:3"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn1.17:1.1","duttitikkhaṃ",0,0],["sn1.17:1.1","abyattenā",0,2],["sn1.17:1.3","ādhāyā",0,8],["sn1.17:2.1","cittaṃ",0,11],["sn1.17:1.3","sambādho",0,14],["sn1.17:3.2","samodahaṃ",2,1],["sn1.17:3.2","samodahaṃ",2,4],["sn1.17:3.3","anissito",2,5]],"before":[{"para":305,"vripara":null,"title":"Dukkarasuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Dukkarasuttavaṇṇanā 17."]}],"after":[{"para":309,"vripara":null,"title":"Dukkarasuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Dukkarasuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 8."]}]},"tika2":null}
